{"path":"utility/expected/~expected","title":"std::expected<T,E>::~expected","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::expected&lt;T,E&gt;::</span>~expected","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/expected/~expected","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Destroys the contained value:","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> ~expected<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"Main_template_destructor\">Main template destructor</h3>\n<p>Destroys the contained value:\n</p>\n<ul><li> If <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/expected/operator_bool\"><code>has_value()</code></a> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>, destroys the expected value.\n</li><li> Otherwise, destroys the unexpected value.\n</li></ul>\n<p>This destructor is trivial if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_destructible\"><span class=\"kw572\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_trivially_destructible_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_destructible\"><span class=\"kw572\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_trivially_destructible_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>E<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> are both <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"void_partial_specialization_destructor\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span></span> partial specialization destructor</h3>\n<p>If <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/expected/operator_bool\"><code>has_value()</code></a> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>, destroys the unexpected value.\n</p><p>This destructor is trivial if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_destructible\"><span class=\"kw572\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_trivially_destructible_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>E<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Main template destructor","id":"Main_template_destructor"},{"depth":3,"text":"void partial specialization destructor","id":"void_partial_specialization_destructor"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/expected","title":"std::expected"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::expected<T,E>::~expected","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23"},{"label":"Main template destructor","note":"Destroys the contained value:"},{"label":"void partial specialization destructor","note":"If has_value() is false, destroys the unexpected value."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":62,"codeBlockCount":0}
